Selfie Segmentation model
=========================

The segmentation model this application runs is not part of this project.
It is downloaded during the build from:

    https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/mediapipe_selfie_segmentation

That is an ONNX conversion of Google's MediaPipe Selfie Segmentation model.
Both the conversion and the original are published under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, a copy of which sits beside this notice.

The download is verified against a SHA-256 recorded in cmake/FetchModel.cmake,
so the file the build uses is the file that was reviewed.

